# FinanceApp — user-supplied domain rules
# Created: 2026-11-28
# Policy-free external Surge ruleset.
# NA/US categories below are reference comments only.
# The calling RULE-SET line applies ONE policy to every rule in this file.

# FinanceApp-NA — reference category
# Bank of America | Requested
# Supplied login and promotion hosts covered by one suffix.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bankofamerica.com

# Citi US | Requested
# The three additional public roots redirected to citi.com in web lookup. Other national Citi domains are outside this draft.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,citi.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,citibank.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,citibankonline.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,citicards.com

# Chase | Requested
# Login host linked by official portal. Corporate JPMorgan sites are reference-only.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chase.com

# Wells Fargo | Requested
# Media and financial guidance hosts linked from official home page; parent suffix coverage is proposed expansion within requested bank scope.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wellsfargo.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wellsfargomedia.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wf.com

# Capital One | Requested
# Supplied login and account host; official portal links verified sign-in and ecm media.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,capitalone.com

# PayPal | Proposed
# Proposed US-oriented route; paypalobjects.com assets also appear in merchant checkouts, so this affects those flows too.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypal.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypalobjects.com

# Fiverr | Proposed
# Screenshot addition; use NA as a provisional route. Shared CDN and social-login hosts not included.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fiverr.com

# TurboTax | Proposed
# Use product suffix plus linked exact account/product hosts; shared Intuit login will affect other Intuit products. No blanket intuit.com suffix.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,turbotax.intuit.com
DOMAIN,accounts.intuit.com
DOMAIN,shop.app.intuit.com

# Venmo | Proposed
# US-payment route proposal; linked app-download host covered.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,venmo.com

# FinanceApp-US — reference category
# American Express US / Europe | Requested
# USER CONFIRMED: all AMEX regions, including US/Europe/HK, use Region-US. Shared parent suffix covers all regional paths and subdomains. Other AMEX-owned domains and authenticated app endpoints remain subject to runtime verification.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,americanexpress.com

# Fidelity | Requested
# Public digital root redirected to fidelity.com. Authenticated API/market-data endpoints not captured.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fidelity.com

# Vanguard | Requested
# Login/account-registration hosts linked by official investor portal.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vanguard.com

# moomoo | Requested
# Official US portal and referral/transfer hosts; Futu-family runtime endpoints remain a coverage gap.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,moomoo.com

# Yahoo Finance | Proposed
# Portal lookup returned 429; domain selected from the official portal URL, not a successful page capture. Suffix covers *.finance.yahoo.com but excludes unrelated Yahoo services. Shared login/CDN dependencies need logs.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,finance.yahoo.com

# Coinbase | Proposed
# Applies the requested trading-platform route as a proposal for this screenshot addition. No account-market eligibility or runtime API coverage was tested.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,coinbase.com

# BIT / Matrixport | Proposed
# Official source identifies Matrixport → BIT rebrand. Trading route is proposed; a US IP does not establish account eligibility or feature access.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,matrixport.com

# Carta | Proposed
# Equity-platform proposal following trading category. Official site links login.app.carta.com. Third-party iframe excluded.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,carta.com

# Lemonade Insurance | Requested
# Supplied /login and official asset hosts covered.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lemonade.com
